[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569605957","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101081#issuecomment-2569605957","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101081","id":2569605957,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZKRNF","user":{"login":"babulusavar","id":36038909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDM4OTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36038909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/babulusavar","html_url":"https://github.com/babulusavar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babulusavar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babulusavar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babulusavar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babulusavar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babulusavar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babulusavar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babulusavar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babulusavar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/babulusavar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T17:52:49Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T17:52:49Z","body":"Thank you for contributing to the Godot Engine and for such a detailed explanation of your changes. The introduction of a debounce mechanism in OS::notify_scale_changed() is a well-thought-out solution to reduce redundant updates. This is particularly important in environments where frequent scale changes could otherwise result in significant CPU overhead.\r\n\r\nThe optimization in Viewport::update_world_size() and DisplayServer::window_set_scale() appears promising for improving both resource utilization and performance stability. I appreciate the addition of performance profiling as it ensures measurable insights into the efficiency of these changes, which can guide further refinements.\r\n\r\nOne suggestion would be to add test coverage for extreme scenarios, such as continuous rapid scale changes over prolonged periods, to validate the robustness of the debounce logic under stress. Additionally, have you considered how these changes might interact with multi-monitor setups or platform-specific implementations?\r\n\r\nOnce again, excellent work on this contribution, and I look forward to seeing how these improvements positively impact scalability and developer experience in Godot!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569605957/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569608915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101081#issuecomment-2569608915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101081","id":2569608915,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZKR7T","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_even